            "content": "<p>The <strong>Ikon JET</strong> is a <strong>multifunctional masturbator</strong> featuring <strong>customizable vibration</strong> with <strong>3 speeds and 7 modes</strong>, as well as a <strong>realistic thrusting function</strong> with <strong>3 speeds and 3 modes</strong>. This allows users to explore different combinations of movement and stimulation for a more tailored experience. It also includes a <strong>heated base</strong> to enhance realism and a <strong>drying function</strong> to support easier maintenance and better hygiene after use.</p><p>The device is made from <strong>premium body-safe materials</strong> and features a <strong>replaceable soft-touch sleeve</strong> with a <strong>magnetic attachment system</strong> for easier handling and secure placement. It is suitable for both <strong>solo and shared use</strong>. The measurements include an <strong>insertable length of 135 mm / 5.3”</strong>, a <strong>diameter of up to 45 mm / 1.7”</strong>, and a <strong>weight of 1400 g / 3.1 lb</strong>.</p>",
